{"hymn":"S81","parent":"E105","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":2},"title":"El no podía salvarse","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su redención","syl":{"n1":"El‿no","n2":["po","i"],"n3":["dí‿a","t"],"n4":["sal","i"],"n5":["var","m"],"n6":["se,","t"],"n8":["Te","i"],"n9":["ní","m"],"n10":["a","t"],"n11":"que","n12":["mo","i"],"n13":["rir,","t"],"n14":["Pa","i"],"n15":["ra","t"],"n16":"que","n17":"la","n18":["pie","i"],"n19":["dad","t"],"n20":["Lle","i"],"n21":["ga","m"],"n22":["ra","t"],"n23":["has","i"],"n24":["ta‿el","t"],"n25":"vil;","n26":"Sí,","n27":["Cris","i"],"n28":["to","t"],"n29":["tu","i"],"n30":["vo","t"],"n31":"que","n32":["san","i"],"n33":["grar,","t"],"n34":["Pa","i"],"n35":["ra‿al","t"],"n36":"vil","n37":["pe","i"],"n38":["ca","m"],"n39":["dor","t"],"n40":["li","i"],"n41":["brar,","t"],"n42":["Pa","i"],"n43":["ra‿al","t"],"n46":"vil","n47":["pe","i"],"n48":["ca","m"],"n49":["dor","t"],"n50":["li","i"],"n51":["brar.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["El no podía salvarse,","Para justicia fue;","Tenían que caer","Las culpas sobre El;","La deuda nuestra así pagó","//Por eso, Dios nos perdonó.//"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["El no podía salvarse,","Pues es Fiador veraz","A los que tienen fe","En Su sangre eficaz;","Nuestro castigo El sufrió","//Cuando Su sangre se vertió.//"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["El no podía salvarse,","¡Qué admirable amor!","En ese amor tan fiel","Hasta Su vida dio;","Su amor derrite el corazón","//Hasta rendirle adoración.//"]}]}